# OBDient environment variables — template
# Copy to .env and fill in your own values.  (.env is gitignored)
#
# AI inference runs 100% ON-DEVICE via the QVAC SDK (@qvac/sdk).
# No inference server, no base URL, no model env var — the model is
# selected in code at src/data/datasources/qvac-sdk.datasource.ts

# VIN decoding uses the keyless NHTSA vPIC API (src/data/datasources/nhtsa.datasource.ts).
# No API key is needed or embedded. The previous Vincario integration was removed
# because its API_KEY and SECRET_KEY were EXPO_PUBLIC_* values inlined into the APK
# (audit C2).

# Anthropic Claude API — the senior-review escalation.
# There is deliberately NO env var for this key. An EXPO_PUBLIC_* value would be
# inlined by Metro into the public JS bundle and extractable from the APK (audit C1).
# The user supplies their own key at runtime in Settings → Claude AI; it is stored
# only on-device and never embedded in the build.
